      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.6,
          "end": 3.53,
          "en": "So how can NextJS help us",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.53,
          "end": 6.84,
          "en": "with optimizing images?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.84,
          "end": 11.55,
          "en": "Well, it helps us by giving us a specific image component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.55,
          "end": 15.84,
          "en": "which we can import from the NextJS package,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 15.84,
          "end": 20.67,
          "en": "which allows us to display images in an optimized way.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 20.67,
          "end": 24.21,
          "en": "Specifically, when using that image component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 24.21,
          "end": 26.16,
          "en": "provided by NextJS.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 26.16,
          "end": 30.15,
          "en": "NextJS will automatically optimize the size",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 30.15,
          "end": 31.53,
          "en": "of the loaded image file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 31.53,
          "end": 35.193,
          "en": "to serve smaller files in optimal formats.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 36.33,
          "end": 39.99,
          "en": "It can also help us with visual stability, as you see here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 39.99,
          "end": 42.66,
          "en": "so that it prevents shifting layouts",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 42.66,
          "end": 46.02,
          "en": "or layouts that jump around as the page is loaded,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 46.02,
          "end": 49.59,
          "en": "and therefore overall, it can speed up the page load time,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 49.59,
          "end": 51.15,
          "en": "also because it, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 51.15,
          "end": 54.388,
          "en": "makes sure that images are only loaded and displayed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 54.388,
          "end": 58.02,
          "en": "when they're actually visible, so that overall,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 58.02,
          "end": 61.32,
          "en": "the performance and the speed of your site improves.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 61.32,
          "end": 64.98,
          "en": "That's the idea behind using this image component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
